      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/oakman_alabama",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Georgia Pacific Railroad arrived in 1884, turning Oakman into a county shipping center and coal‑mining hub.",
